{"494240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pengame", "steam_appid": 494240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pengame is a <strong>2D shooter platformer</strong> set in an imaginative, <strong>frame-by-frame animated</strong> world. Explore a monster-infested notebook as <strong>the hand-drawn hero, Stickman</strong>, who is destined to <strong>defeat the vilest creature ever</strong> sketched on a page: The Teacher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/b7bd85b5754ec04e85dc34a2792a2c7d.poster.avif?t=1786183324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/b7bd85b5754ec04e85dc34a2792a2c7d.webm?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/b7bd85b5754ec04e85dc34a2792a2c7d.mp4?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young student, bored during his classes, has created a vast world in his notebook. There was peace and harmony, until he made a horrible mistake: he sketched the most horrifying thing he could imagine on one of the sacred pages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the notebook as <strong>Stickman</strong>, one of the numerous chosen ones destined to cleanse this hand-drawn world from the evil influence of <strong>The Teacher</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/e7309af74294fb72abeab84c4ccc71eb.poster.avif?t=1786183324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/e7309af74294fb72abeab84c4ccc71eb.webm?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/e7309af74294fb72abeab84c4ccc71eb.mp4?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat and exploration are the heart of Pengame. Stickman is a natural jumper, with some less-than-natural time manipulation abilities. He also has access to various weapons, with unique strengths and weaknesses. Mastering his arsenal and making use of his time manipulation talents are crucial to prevail against overwhelming odds and traverse through the most treacherous areas of the notebook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double jumping</strong> &amp; <strong>wall jumps</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash teleportation</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique guns</strong>, each with an <strong>alternative firing</strong> mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various temporarily <strong>wieldable superweapons</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time manipulation abilities (<strong>Bullet time</strong> &amp; <strong>Time reverse</strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d8d47cc52ea06fcd8f2b3f9880493ddd.poster.avif?t=1786183324\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d8d47cc52ea06fcd8f2b3f9880493ddd.webm?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d8d47cc52ea06fcd8f2b3f9880493ddd.mp4?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should you expect to find in Pengame?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn graphics</strong> along with <strong>frame-by-frame animation</strong> (all done on paper).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original fully <strong>voice-acted</strong> <strong>story campaign</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over<strong> 40 unique enemy types </strong>and<strong> 7 bosses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linear story progression</strong> through hand-crafted levels, with <strong>optional exploration</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>gauntlet mode</strong> for those who want to keep going after beating the campaign.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d38bd449f89cd2f6e407cec6e7e15d98.poster.avif?t=1786183324\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d38bd449f89cd2f6e407cec6e7e15d98.webm?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d38bd449f89cd2f6e407cec6e7e15d98.mp4?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pengame is a <strong>2D shooter platformer</strong> set in an imaginative, <strong>frame-by-frame animated</strong> world. Explore a monster-infested notebook as <strong>the hand-drawn hero, Stickman</strong>, who is destined to <strong>defeat the vilest creature ever</strong> sketched on a page: The Teacher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/b7bd85b5754ec04e85dc34a2792a2c7d.poster.avif?t=1786183324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/b7bd85b5754ec04e85dc34a2792a2c7d.webm?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/b7bd85b5754ec04e85dc34a2792a2c7d.mp4?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young student, bored during his classes, has created a vast world in his notebook. There was peace and harmony, until he made a horrible mistake: he sketched the most horrifying thing he could imagine on one of the sacred pages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the notebook as <strong>Stickman</strong>, one of the numerous chosen ones destined to cleanse this hand-drawn world from the evil influence of <strong>The Teacher</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/e7309af74294fb72abeab84c4ccc71eb.poster.avif?t=1786183324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/e7309af74294fb72abeab84c4ccc71eb.webm?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/e7309af74294fb72abeab84c4ccc71eb.mp4?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat and exploration are the heart of Pengame. Stickman is a natural jumper, with some less-than-natural time manipulation abilities. He also has access to various weapons, with unique strengths and weaknesses. Mastering his arsenal and making use of his time manipulation talents are crucial to prevail against overwhelming odds and traverse through the most treacherous areas of the notebook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double jumping</strong> &amp; <strong>wall jumps</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash teleportation</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique guns</strong>, each with an <strong>alternative firing</strong> mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various temporarily <strong>wieldable superweapons</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time manipulation abilities (<strong>Bullet time</strong> &amp; <strong>Time reverse</strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d8d47cc52ea06fcd8f2b3f9880493ddd.poster.avif?t=1786183324\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d8d47cc52ea06fcd8f2b3f9880493ddd.webm?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d8d47cc52ea06fcd8f2b3f9880493ddd.mp4?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should you expect to find in Pengame?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn graphics</strong> along with <strong>frame-by-frame animation</strong> (all done on paper).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original fully <strong>voice-acted</strong> <strong>story campaign</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over<strong> 40 unique enemy types </strong>and<strong> 7 bosses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linear story progression</strong> through hand-crafted levels, with <strong>optional exploration</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>gauntlet mode</strong> for those who want to keep going after beating the campaign.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d38bd449f89cd2f6e407cec6e7e15d98.poster.avif?t=1786183324\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d38bd449f89cd2f6e407cec6e7e15d98.webm?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d38bd449f89cd2f6e407cec6e7e15d98.mp4?t=1786183324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Play as the stickman you drew in your school notebook to defeat the ultimate evil: the TEACHER!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/1df8f7d6aa0942b89762192fb30bdf7de88cd524/header.jpg?t=1786183324", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/cb706049ed67d1b68e0cd6c1ba5b5b8f73498445/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786183324", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/cb706049ed67d1b68e0cd6c1ba5b5b8f73498445/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786183324", "website": "http://presskit.playpengame.com/"